  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second National Climate Resilience Project (NCRP2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In support of the Government of Malawi&#x2019;s (GoM) ongoing adaptation and resilience building efforts, UNDP and the Environmental Affairs Department (EAD) have collaborated on the development of the Second National Climate Resilience Project &#x2018;NCRP2&#x2019; &#x2014; a policy-level project aimed at continuing the legacy of the original &#x2018;NCRP1&#x2019;. NCRP2 addresses a significant development challenge in Malawi, namely the limited systemic impact of resilience-building efforts in climate change (CC) and environmental and</narrative>
  </description>
